<sect2 id="gimp-image-mode">
  <title><quote>Mode</quote> Submenu</title>

  <indexterm>
    <primary>Modos (Cores)</primary>
    <secondary>Submenu</secondary>
  </indexterm>
  <indexterm>
    <primary>Imagem</primary>
    <secondary>Modos de cor</secondary>
    <tertiary>Menu</tertiary>
  </indexterm>

  <para>O submenu <guimenuitem>Modo</guimenuitem> contém comandos que permitem que você altere o modo de cor da imagem. Atualmente há três modos.</para>

  <sect3>
    <title>Ativando o submenu</title>
    <para>
      You can access this submenu from the main menu through
      <menuchoice>
        <guimenu>Image</guimenu>
        <guimenuitem>Mode</guimenuitem>
      </menuchoice>.
    </para>
  </sect3>

  <sect3>
    <title>O conteúdo do submenu <quote>Modo</quote></title>
    <itemizedlist>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          <link linkend="gimp-image-convert-rgb">RGB</link>
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          <link linkend="gimp-image-convert-grayscale">Tons de cinza</link>
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          <link linkend="gimp-image-convert-indexed">Indexado</link>
        </para>
      </listitem>
    </itemizedlist>
  </sect3>
</sect2>
